{'symbol': 'CEG', 'date': '2023-04-26 11:14:00', 'title': 'CONSTELLATION ENERGY CORPORATION DECLARES DIVIDEND', 'text': "BALTIMORE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CONSTELLATION ENERGY CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CEG) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.282 PER SHARE ON CONSTELLATION'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 9, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF 5 P.M. EASTERN TIME ON MAY 12, 2023. ABOUT CONSTELLATION HEADQUARTERED IN BALTIMORE, CONSTELLATION ENERGY CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CEG) IS THE NATION'S LARGEST PRODUCER OF CLEAN, CARBON-FREE ENERGY AND A LEADING SUPPLIER OF ENERGY PRODUCTS AND SE."}